Description: A comprehensive meta-analysis module for jamovi, powered by
    the R package meta. It features two-group meta-analysis for
    continuous, binary, and incidence rate outcomes, precomputed effect
    sizes meta-analysis, and risk-of-bias plots. Meta-analysis features
    include common-effect and random-effects models, subgroup analysis,
    meta-regression, leave-one-out analysis, cumulative meta-analysis, and
    publication bias.
